# The ancestry of every game class scripts/tandem wraps (class < parent < ...),
# from the decompiled scripts of game 2.50. tools/scripts-threads.py reads it to
# tell what exists once per entity, component or persistent state; rewrite it
# with `tools/scripts-threads.py --classes VANILLA.reds` when a wrap of a new
# class is added (or add the line by hand).
